      </div>
      <div class="hero-bottom"><span>DESIGN · DEVELOP · VERIFY</span><a href="#works">SCROLL <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section works" id="works" aria-labelledby="works-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / SAMPLES</p><h2 id="works-title">技術サンプル</h2></div><p class="section-intro">動くサンプルと、その裏側の記録</p></div>
      <div class="preparing">
